{"obsah":"<p><strong>17/6 Jablonné – UEC European Marathon Championships</strong></p>\n\n<p>The slightly tabloid headline of this report literally reflects the type of events our team took part in.</p>\n\n<p>First up were the European Marathon Championships, with Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček and Martin Šimůnek, who besides the main exhibition at the opening ceremony also rode at the local school for almost 300 pupils, including a small workshop. On the square there was a slight delay to the ceremony itself, but the spectators cheered all the more even in the rising heat.</p>\n\n<p><strong>18/6 Ralsko – Forestry Days 2022</strong></p>\n\n<p>Forestry Days is a traditional event where over 15,000 people head to the middle of the forest to admire forestry machinery, hunters' trophies and everything connected with the forest and its care. Martin Šimůnek, Dominik Budský and Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček could already feel the approaching heat right behind their ears, but they still rode a relatively brisk exhibition on the STIHL Timbersports stage, including jumping over champion lumberjacks. Pack up and head for the furnace of Česká Lípa …</p>\n\n<p><strong>Česká Lípa – Town festival</strong></p>\n\n<p>During the day the centre of Česká Lípa welcomed literally thousands of people, who enjoyed both the nearby fair and attractions and the main stage, where a number of well-known bands performed. Scorching heat of over 32 degrees and an asphalt surface aren't exactly ideal for drawing people in, but our team still managed to fill the square. Martin Šimůnek, Vlasta, Dominik Budský (unicyclist) and Matouš Balík were joined by local Trial legend and Martin's first student Majkl Matys, who got his Trial bike out after many years and showed that some things you never forget. Thanks partly to his help the heat was bearable, and together with Vlasta they pulled off big ones over the tape along with the competitors. Four generations of Trial riders effectively had a chance to meet at the exhibition.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Liberec – international Megamini handball tournament</strong></p>\n\n<p>Without Michal and Dominik, our team headed to Liberec for an event for a few hundred enthusiastic handball players. Luckily the exhibition was aimed at the after-party, held outdoors and in the shade. The heat had caused one of the ramps onto the obstacles to crack at the previous exhibitions, and the riders were showing a certain amount of fatigue too. But the crowd of enthusiastic athletes gave us energy, and with help from the club's little ones Marty and Nikolka Kabeláč, a 30-minute show got going that entertained kids and adults alike. Matouš Balík seemed the freshest of all – he even won the mini contest in the tape jump. We got home well after 10, but full of experiences.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F06%2FIMG_5845-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F06%2FIMG_5845.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-209375\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F06%2FIMG_5876-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F06%2FIMG_5876.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-209374\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F06%2FIMG_5822-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2F